  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "USB: Store endpoint with direction flag in usb_conv_info",
  "description": "Commit 9605f3d3f44f (\"USB: Differentiate IN and OUT endpoints\") solved the issue where IN and OUT endpoints with same numbers were treated as the same endpoint. However, the commit failed to make sure that the endpoint stored in usb_conv_info includes direction. This lead to dissectors that do store endpoint numbers during descriptor processing to no longer be able to match data on IN endpoints. In USB MSC UASP case this lead to Data In and Status no longer being dissected.\n\nFix the issue by storing endpoint together with direction flag.",
